{"id":"khoroshen_ko","lemma":"хорошенько","pos":"adv","rank":1341,"glosses":["very well, thoroughly, properly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/da/Ru-%D1%85%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%88%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%8C%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D1%85%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%88%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%8C%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Хорошенько вымой руки.","en":"Wash your hands well.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1091555","words":[null,null,{"g":"hand","l":"рука"}]},{"text":"Мой свои руки хорошенько.","en":"Wash your hands well.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"one's own","l":"свой"},{"g":"hand","l":"рука"},null]},{"text":"Подумай хорошенько, прежде чем ответить.","en":"Think carefully before answering.","words":[{"g":"to think","l":"подумать"},null,null,null,{"g":"to answer, to reply"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"previous to, before"]]},{"text":"Посмотрите хорошенько.","en":"Take a good look.","words":[{"g":"to look","l":"посмотреть"},null]},{"text":"Посмотри хорошенько.","en":"Take a good look.","words":[{"g":"to look","l":"посмотреть"},null]}]}